    <description>Installs an augmetic replacement arm designed for the Sicarian corps of Infiltrators and Ruststalkers. These unnerving multiply-jointed arms are resilient and capable, and designed for the most intense battles in harsh conditions, but are unsuitable for use on less extensively modified humans.</description>
    <jobString>Installing Sicarian arm.</jobString>
    <ingredients>
